+// Architecture 2026-07-19 (post-K1 TimePitch audible failure + hist-r1 drop+live veto):
+//
+// ABANDONED permanently:
+//   A) drop+live / history restretch after baking rate into deep wall queue
+//   B) AVAudioUnitTimePitch as rate applicator (device: grit/失真; clock OK but ear fails)
+//
+// REQUIRED contract (JIT stretch, rate-agnostic reserve):
+//   core (aout-handles-rate / 0012) → RAW content PCM into this module
+//   DEEP raw reserve (rate-agnostic) — never bake rate into the long buffer
+//   JIT module scaletempo at CURRENT rate → SHALLOW wall schedule on PlayerNode
+//   changeRate = setTempoRate only (NO drop / NO restretch / NO TimePitch)
+//   Engage residual ≤ shallow wall (~250 ms), not multi-second stock queue
+//   TimingReport = content PTS consumed (not wall samples)
+//   play(date) for first start; flush only seek/discontinuity; real drain
+//   interruption / route / engine-config → pause or aout_RestartRequest
