+//
+// FEED-DIAG (2026-07-19, instrumentation retained):
+//   R2 ear veto: cyclic ~5s raw underrun + drop-newest holes.
+//   Logs [avae-feed] enqueue/drop/underrun edges + 500ms timeline to prove
+//   whether core stops play:, aout drains without refill, or drop digs holes.
+//
+// FEED-FIX K2.3 (2026-07-19) — raw bank covers full inter-arrival:
+//   Device FEED-DIAG proved ~5s demux/aout bursts into a 4s hard drop cap:
+//     accept ~4.25s → DROP newest ~0.75s/cycle → dEnq=0 ~4.5s → raw→0 →
+//     UNDERRUN_EDGE (lastEnqAgoMs~4300) → next burst. dropF += ~36k/cycle.
+//   Policy: kAVAEMaxRawSec=8s (design bank ≥ burst+margin; always accept);
+//           kAVAEHardRawSec=12s (emergency ceiling only; DROP reason=hard_ceiling).
+//   Between 8s and 12s: still ACCEPT + rate-limited RAW_HIGH (no holes).
+//   Shallow wall stays 0.25s (hold residual only) — do NOT deepen wall as fix.
+//   Not a 0007 standing decoder cap; not drop+live; not TimePitch-as-rate.
+//   No P4.3/F20 FIXED claim until R2 ear green.
