+//        Larger 1× prefill buys more content runway before 2× empties bank.
+//        changeRate into non-unity logs RATE_LOW_BANK if rawSec < 2s.
+//   Fingerprint: JIT-scaletempo K2.4 FEED-FIX / timing-hold raw=12s hard=18s.
+//   Residual: demux may still not feed 2× continuous — bank only buys time.
